cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Sonification Framework for GPCR Molecular Dynamics —
  open-source pipeline with cross-modal classification validation,
  demonstrated on the β2-adrenergic receptor
message: >-
  If you use this software or its outputs, please cite the Zenodo
  deposit listed below.
